<h2>What we use</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Session cookie:</strong> needed to keep you signed in when you log in to the admin panel. It is purely technical — without it you couldn't use your account — and does not require your consent.</li>
    <li><strong>Language preference (<code>site_lang</code>):</strong> a cookie that remembers the language you choose on these pages, for one year. It is only created if you change the language with the selector.</li>
    <li><strong>Theme preference (light/dark):</strong> stored in your browser's local storage (not exactly a cookie) to remember how you prefer to see the panel.</li>
</ul>

<h2>What we don't use</h2>
<p>We do not use advertising or third-party tracking cookies.</p>

<h2>How to manage them</h2>
<p>You can delete or block cookies in your browser settings. Note that blocking the session cookie will prevent you from logging in to the admin panel.</p>

<p>For more information on how we handle your data, see our <a href="{{ path('app_privacy') }}">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
